  "description": "Resend transport for Auderz.Shared.Notifications. Sends real email through resend.com so a\n      whole team can read it on one dashboard rather than in one developer's console, with a\n      sandbox recipient that redirects every message away from real addresses, a subject prefix,\n      and per-message tags for environment, service and template so the dashboard can be filtered.\n      Off unless configured; usable in any environment.",
