  "releaseNotes": "1.2.6: EmailAttachment has an optional ContentId for inline images. Set it and the HTML body can show the image with src=\"cid:{ContentId}\" - a logo in the header, for example - instead of the client listing it as a file. The Resend sender passes it through as Resend's content id. Existing callers are unaffected: the parameter is last and defaults to null. No configuration change needed.",
